        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "timestamp": "2026-05-30T14:04:05.741705",
      "agent_id": "pro_agent",
      "round": 3,
      "text": "The World Health Organization's classification of processed meat as a carcinogen does indeed imply a link between red meat consumption and colorectal cancer risk, as the organization's classification is based on the cumulative evidence from multiple studies, including those on unprocessed red meat.",
