      "agent_id": "con_agent",
      "round": 3,
      "text": "The World Health Organization's classification of processed meat as a carcinogen does not necessarily imply a link between all red meat consumption and colorectal cancer risk, as the organization's classification is based on the specific characteristics of processed meat, not unprocessed red meat.",
      "citations": [
        {
